"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair came in at 40% of normal on the middle of the grids, and July to August was at 63%. Grid 25120 had its driest year in 1965 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
